      "content": "It sounds like you are in immense pain, and the idea of fading out might feel like the only escape from this overwhelming feeling of emptiness. However, those profound feelings of meaninglessness are symptoms of distress, not necessarily facts about your life. Please remember that even when everything feels hollow, your life has inherent value, and there are strong reasons for you to stay. Can you give yourself just a little more time, and perhaps try grounding yourself with something tangible, like holding an ice cube?",
      "source": "target",
